  m_text: "1. Yellow Orbs are where you are to pick up clients food orders.\n2. Green
    Orbs are where you are to deliver clients food orders.\n3. Each delivery you
    complete will earn you 200 points.\n4. Power Ups:\n    4.1: Gold coins will earn
    you 10 extra points.\n    4.2: Blue cubes will give you 30 more seconds on the
    clock.\n    4.3: Green cubes will double your current points.\n5. Upgrades:\n   
    5.1: Spray Can icon will change the color of your car.\n    5.2: Sticker icon
    will unlock a sticker decal on you car."
